# Parallel agent coordination (LLMChat)

Multiple agents may edit this repo at the same time. Reduce conflicts:

## Ownership (prefer)

- **Unity 在线翻译**: `backend/src/UnityAutoTranslator.*`, `frontend/src/components/UnityTranslateView.tsx`, Unity-related CSS under `.unity-*`
- **OCR / 粘贴**: `frontend/src/components/ImageOcrView.tsx` (unless another agent owns the current OCR task)
- **Do not casually rewrite**: `frontend/src/modelPresets.ts`, unrelated settings tabs, PDF/literature unless that is your task

## Shared hubs (touch carefully)

When you must edit shared files (`App.tsx`, `api.ts`, `styles.css`, `HttpServer.cpp`, `Config.*`):

1. Re-read the file immediately before editing
2. Make the smallest possible hunk (add route / import / nav item only)
3. Do not reformat unrelated regions
4. After edit, re-check `git diff` for accidental overwrites

## Packaging

- Portable packaging uses `CARGO_TARGET_DIR` via `scripts/make-portable.ps1` — do not revert that
- Prefer not to kill/rebuild over another agent’s in-progress verify unless the user asks
